  "description": "FurSquare (เฟอร์สแควร์) was an annual furry and kemono goods fair, a dōjinshi-style fair, held in Bangkok, Thailand, organized by Urban Wealth Union. It featured a marketplace where artists, dealers and creators sold goods, alongside community events. The first FurSquare was held on September 8, 2018, and the last on September 7, 2024, with the number of registered circles growing from 46 to 120.",
